@host = http://localhost:5067

### Submit an enquiry (valid) -> 200, saves + queues the two emails
POST {{host}}/api/user/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "phoneNo": "07123456789",
  "subject": "Interested in ITQ valves",
  "message": "Please send me a quote for the ITQ range.",
  "company": "Acme Ltd"
}

### Submit an enquiry (invalid: missing email/subject) -> 400 with field errors
POST {{host}}/api/user/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "",
  "phoneNo": "07123456789",
  "subject": "",
  "message": "hi",
  "company": ""
}

### Health check -> 200 (served natively)
GET {{host}}/health

### A route the new backend does NOT own -> proxied to the OLD backend via YARP
GET {{host}}/api/categories
